<section class="mission-bg" id="mission">
    <div class="mission">
        <div class="mission-text reveal">
            <div class="section-label">Our Mission</div>
            <h2 class="section-h2" style="color:white;">
                Bridging Classical &amp; Quantum Worlds
            </h2>
            <p class="mission-body">
                Funded by Horizon Europe and the EuroHPC Joint Undertaking
                alongside Japan's Strategic Innovation Promotion Program (SIP),
                Q-Neko advances five closely connected ambitions in hybrid
                HPC+AI+QC - from algorithm development to
                industrial-grade deployment.
            </p>
            <blockquote class="mission-quote">
                "Q-Neko will drive the emerging promise of combining traditional
                supercomputing with quantum acceleration towards concrete
                societal impact."
                <cite>- Mikael Johansson, Project Coordinator, CSC</cite>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="mission-pillars reveal">
            <div class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar-num">01</span>
                <div>
                    <div class="pillar-title">Researcher Exchange</div>
                    <div class="pillar-desc">
                        Intensifying scientific networking between European and
                        Japanese quantum communities through active researcher
                        and engineer exchange programs.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar-num">02</span>
                <div>
                    <div class="pillar-title">Technology Roadmap</div>
                    <div class="pillar-desc">
                        Producing a forward-looking roadmap to strengthen secure
                        supply chains and guide long-term strategic
                        collaboration across both regions.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar-num">03</span>
                <div>
                    <div class="pillar-title">Quantum Solution Library</div>
                    <div class="pillar-desc">
                        Assembling a high-impact library of quantum-enabled
                        solutions targeting pressing scientific and industrial
                        challenges.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar-num">04</span>
                <div>
                    <div class="pillar-title">Benchmarks &amp; Standards</div>
                    <div class="pillar-desc">
                        Contributing to robust benchmarks and
                        pre-standardization efforts in the emerging field of
                        HPC–quantum integration.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar-num">05</span>
                <div>
                    <div class="pillar-title">HPC+AI+QC Software Stack</div>
                    <div class="pillar-desc">
                        Advancing the unified software stack required for
                        seamless integration of classical supercomputing, AI,
                        and quantum computing.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
